{%- comment -%}
  When a coming-soon piece goes live: its hikari.release date (Date and time metafield),
  else the Edition day from theme settings. Plain text, for the card and the product page.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign rel = p.metafields.hikari.release.value -%}
{%- if rel -%}{{ rel | date: '%a %-d %b, %H:%M' }}{%- else -%}{{ settings.edition_day }}{%- endif -%}
